Fix collection value bug + show per-variant badges in set grid

Collection value fix:
- handleAddToCollection now uses ebayFetchedPrice as fallback when
  getUKPrice(card) returns null, so priceGBP is stored correctly
- Added useEffect that auto-backfills priceGBP on existing null-price
  collection items when the eBay price finishes loading
- Added updateCollectionItemPrice helper in lib/storage.ts
- Extended PUT /api/collection/:id to accept standalone priceGBP updates
  (price-only update when quantity is undefined) and combined qty+price
  update when both are provided

Set grid variant badges:
- collectionMap now tracks per-variant counts per card
  {total, variants: Record<string, number>}
- CollectionBadge replaced pokeball-count icons with H/R/N variant
  pills (gold=Holo, blue=Reverse Holo, silver=Non-Holo) with ×qty
  shown when count > 1
- CardGridItem updated to receive collectionData instead of collectionCount
